{"text":"At its very best, the Western model speaks for itself. It's the model that put food on the table, it's the refrigerators, it put a man on the moon. But the fact of the matter is, although people back in the day used to point at the Western countries and say, I want that, I like that, there's now a new person in town in the form of a country, China. Today, generations are looking at China and saying China can produce infrastructure, China can produce economic growth. And we like that. Because ultimately, the question before us and the question before 7 billion people on the planet is how can we create prosperity? People will care and will pivot towards the model of politics and economics in a very rational way to those models that will ensure that they can have better living standards in the shortest period of time.","words":[{"text":"At","start":0.98,"end":1.46},{"text":"its","start":1.46,"end":1.64},{"text":"very","start":1.64,"end":1.92},{"text":"best","start":1.92,"end":2.36,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":2.98,"end":3.04},{"text":"Western","start":3.04,"end":3.38},{"text":"model","start":3.38,"end":3.78},{"text":"speaks","start":3.78,"end":4.1},{"text":"for","start":4.1,"end":4.36},{"text":"itself","start":4.36,"end":4.72,"punct":"."},{"text":"It's","start":5.16,"end":5.34},{"text":"the","start":5.34,"end":5.46},{"text":"model","start":5.46,"end":5.66},{"text":"that","start":5.66,"end":5.86},{"text":"put","start":5.86,"end":6.08},{"text":"food","start":6.08,"end":6.3},{"text":"on","start":6.3,"end":6.48},{"text":"the","start":6.48,"end":6.6},{"text":"table","start":6.6,"end":6.96,"punct":","},{"text":"it's","start":7.5,"end":7.64},{"text":"the","start":7.64,"end":7.78},{"text":"refrigerators","start":7.78,"end":8.62,"punct":","},{"text":"it","start":8.88,"end":9.12},{"text":"put","start":9.12,"end":9.26},{"text":"a","start":9.26,"end":9.38},{"text":"man","start":9.38,"end":9.58},{"text":"on","start":9.58,"end":9.88},{"text":"the","start":9.88,"end":1